Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Soo-hyun - Kim Ji-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Park Sung-hoon - Kwak Dong-yeon - Lee Joo-bin{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Gab-soo - Lee Mi-sook{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jung Jin-young - Na Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jeon Bae-soo - Hwang Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Jung-nan - Kim Joo-ryoung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jang Yoon-ju - Kim Do-hyun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Screenwriter: Park Ji-eun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Mga Direktor: Jang Young-woo - Kim Hee-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Reyna ng Luha{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.64,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin mo sa akin na hindi ito totoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.61,0:01:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Divorce Settlement Agreement{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.61,0:01:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin mo na.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.11,0:01:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Tanggihan ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hae-in...\N- Sabihin mo na.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.95,0:01:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin mo sa akin na hindi ito totoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.75,0:01:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin mo sa akin na hindi ikaw iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.30,0:01:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.68,0:01:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na hindi ko masabi sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailan...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailan mo ito inihanda?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Meron akong...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.55,0:02:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}may sasabihin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.89,0:02:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Marahil...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.77,0:02:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,sa araw na iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.31,0:02:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang araw na sinabi ko sa iyo na namamatay na ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.69,0:02:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya ba...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.37,0:02:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,ipinapanatili mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,tikom ang iyong bibig,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,at hindi sinabi sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahil malapit na akong mamatay, gayon pa man?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:03:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,nagsinungaling ka sa lahat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang mali?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagsinungaling ka sa pamamagitan ng iyong mga ngipin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.92,0:03:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so ano ang pumipigil sa iyo ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nahanap ko na...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:04:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,papunta ako rito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nandito pa rin ang lock namin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.31,0:05:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huli na para pumunta kahit saan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Manatili dito. pupunta ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.49,0:05:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Basta...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,iwanan mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala akong...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,ang lakas para magalit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pakinggan mo lang ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasabihin ko sa iyo kung bakit ko ginawa iyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,kung ano ang naramdaman ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.47,0:05:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,at kung ano ang plano ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.73,0:05:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, kalimutan mo na.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.73,0:06:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mahal kita, Hong Hae-in.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mahal kita.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.99,0:06:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Okay ka lang?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.99,0:08:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo ba alam na dapat kang maging mas maingat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumasok na tayo sa loob.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ipapaliwanag ko ang lahat,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,at pagkatapos...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.01,0:08:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gagawin ko ang sinabi mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.26,0:08:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- kaya...\N- Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung mangyari ulit ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,wag mo akong iligtas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nabigla ako.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.49,0:09:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Normal si Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ano ang ibig mong sabihin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Akala ko kanina lang ay wala na siya sa isip niya,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.25,0:09:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}dahil mukhang mahal niya si Hae-in,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ngunit katulad siya ng ibang lalaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nagulat din ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sino ang nakakaalam na pinaplano niya\Nna hiwalayan siya ng palihim?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.59,0:10:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}- I wonder kung kailan nagsimula ang lahat.\N- Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tiyak na may nagpalakas ng loob sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}May pinaghihinalaan din ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.72,0:10:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sino?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tita ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.44,0:10:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.28,0:10:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay humahadlang sa akin\Nand nagsasalita ng walang kapararakan kamakailan,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,tungkol sa pagiging mas gwapo sa akin ni Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.91,0:10:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamakailan ay parang nagbabahagi ng sikreto ang dalawang iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.08,0:10:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakita ko sila last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ang pinakamalaking priyoridad ng negosyong ito...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.59,0:10:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Ano ang nangyayari?\N- Kaya bakit hindi ka pumunta?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.84,0:10:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Bakit siya pumuntang mag-isa?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.64,0:10:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Bakit mo siya hinayaang umalis mag-isa?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Send who alone?\N- Bakit?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ano? Bakit siya umiiyak?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.85,0:10:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-uusap sila nang palihim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.53,0:10:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.31,0:12:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Saan ka pupunta?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.39,0:12:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nabagsak ang treatment, ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.06,0:12:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang ibig niyang sabihin ay kailangan natin ng oras.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumalik tayo sa Korea,\Nitaas ang iyong WBC, pagkatapos ay bumalik...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kasuklam-suklam ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong masaya ka na mamamatay na ako,\Ibinigay na ni Nand ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibinigay mo na ang lahat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya hindi ka na mag-abala pang sumubok?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta naman ang demanda?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.59,0:13:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Magpapasalamat ako kung hiniwalayan mo ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.59,0:13:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,nang hindi nagsampa ng demanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano?\N- Alam mo na ang lahat ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo ako papakawalan ng ganoon kadali.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.31,0:13:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Gayunpaman, hindi kakayanin ang mamuhay kasama ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kang umarte na parang wala kang ideya, Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam mo kung anong klase kang tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.62,0:13:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi nakakagulat na pinili kong gawin iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.70,0:13:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Namuhay sana ako ng komportable at mayaman,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.87,0:13:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,so bakit ko gustong tumakas?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.67,0:14:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahil kinasusuklaman ko ang pamumuhay\N kasama ka nang higit sa anupaman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Baek Hyun-woo.\N- Oo, tama ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.39,0:14:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Magiging tapat ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nang mabalitaan kong malapit ka nang mamatay,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.52,0:14:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Napahinga ako ng malalim.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.40,0:14:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Magkaroon tayo ng malinis na diborsyo\Kung titiisin kita...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.69,0:14:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,para sa susunod na tatlong buwan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,pero nahuli ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasira ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.71,0:14:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung pipiliin mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,not to take any action\Nat all and just divorce me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,sa totoo lang,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Magpapasalamat ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.06,0:14:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gagawin mo ba iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang dapat kong gawin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.19,0:15:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat ba akong mag-impake at umalis kapag bumalik na tayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.53,0:15:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,O...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,kung ako ay patuloy na mangungulit sa iyong\Nfeet, rebisahin mo ba ang iyong kalooban?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sigurado ka bang kaya mo ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.21,0:15:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo kakayanin mo ang galit ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay dalhin ito!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang gagawin mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumawa ka kung kaya mo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.13,0:16:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Dumaan ang kanta sa kanyang\Nunang round ng mga interogasyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit ang aming mga abogado ay nagdududa na ang\Npag-uusig ay titigil dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung ganyan ang prosecution magpapatuloy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,pagkatapos ay isang oras lang hanggang sa ipatawag ka nila.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.19,0:16:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo itong gulo na kinalalagyan natin, salamat kay Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-aalala ako sa pagpapatawag nila sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.11,0:16:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan mong inumin ang iyong mga gamot sa oras.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari kang pumunta sa halip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.95,0:16:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sorry?\N- Anong mali?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakulong ako sa loob ng sampung buwan\Nnung kaedad ko si Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.08,0:16:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung kasing bata lang ako ni Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka nakatingin sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang karanasan na hindi mo mabibili ng pera.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.43,0:17:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako interesado.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung lilitaw ka bilang kahalili niya,\NIisipin ng mga tao na ikaw ang tagapagmana,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,pero kung hindi, iisipin nilang grabe ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,May pamilya akong dapat protektahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.27,0:17:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Gayundin ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.15,0:17:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, ako iyon. Dapat protektahan mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.11,0:17:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang sinasabi mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.61,0:17:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumahimik!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.78,0:17:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang problema ay may paparating tayong mahalagang investment deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung malalaman ng mga investor,\Nbaka matuloy ang deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama siya, sir. Dapat nating bilisan ang pakikitungo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayroon kaming isang buong handaan sa harap namin...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,na maaaring kunin ni Chairman Yeom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.09,0:17:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,, Malalaman din ng mga reporter sa madaling panahon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Si Yoon ay mag-o-opt out kaagad, pagkatapos,\Nand iyon ang gusto ni Chairman Yeom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.63,0:17:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Una kailangan nating i-secure ang deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lolo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Queens Mart Pumasok sa Bagong Resort Business{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.32,0:18:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa sandaling magsimula ang konstruksiyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.83,0:18:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,ipapakita namin ang isyu sa paglilisensya\Nkaugnay sa mga paghihigpit sa altitude...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,sa mga namumuhunan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapos yung mga investors at stock\Nfirms na nagbigay ng loan...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.75,0:18:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,ay pipiliin ang opsyong pre-payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Soo-cheol, ang duwag na yan, magugulat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.71,0:18:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Baka umiyak pa siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.55,0:19:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Doon ako mag-aalok na mag-invest ng halaga...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,nag-pull out na ang mga investor,\Nagmungkahi si Nand ng mga convertible bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.76,0:19:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay kung kailan mag-iimbestiga ang prosekusyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.73,0:19:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa sandaling makuha ang balita sa paglustay\Nout at ang pamilya Hong ay nakulong,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Gagamitin ko ang mga convertible bond\Nupang bumili ng mga stock ng Queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.11,0:19:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay isasama ko iyon sa\Nsa 4.9% na binili ko dati,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,at naging pinakamalaking shareholder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lahat ay nag-pan out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kahit si Hyun-woo ay wala sa picture ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ang nakakaalam na mahahanap natin ang diborsiyo\Npaper sa ganitong perpektong timing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.09,0:19:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Aminin ba ito ni Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirmahan ba niya ang divorce papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.13,0:19:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo kailangang magtanong? Syempre siya yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano niya ito magagawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.09,0:19:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka ba nagtataka?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.85,0:19:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghiwalay na lang sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ni-bug niya ang kwarto mo at ibinigay\Nang mga tape sa prosecution,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,pero nakalilipas ako sa kanila.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo gagawin?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang aming pamilya ay lubos na nagpaparaya\No sa mga paghihirap ng kanilang mga magulang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.36,0:19:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang bagay na hindi ko maintindihan...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,gusto ba ng hamak na hiwalayan muna siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.86,0:20:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon ang isang bagay na naiintindihan ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sigurado akong may tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.24,0:20:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Marahil isang maybahay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Father, titingnan ko po.\N- Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.71,0:20:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gagawin ng audit team.\N- Gagawin nila?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Iiwan niya si Queens pagkatapos ng divorce.\NI need to find out before then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Titingnan ko ang kanyang computer,\N mga dokumentong pinansyal, telepono, at account.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,susubaybayan ko ang kanyang mga pondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.93,0:20:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Aalamin ko kung sino ang nakilala niya\Nand kung ano ang pinagdaanan niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa sandaling makakita ako ng anumang\Nembezzlement o ilegal na pagkilos,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Iuulat ko siya, at maghain ng claim para sa mga pinsala.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.31,0:20:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ganyan ka pupunta?\N- Oo, gagawin ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako na ang bahala, kaya\Nplease huwag kang hadlang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.63,0:20:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay walang awa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabi ko susunduin kita sa airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.38,0:21:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, nasaktan ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.63,0:21:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Naririnig mo ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring pumutok ang iyong eardrums kapag binugbog ka.\N nangyayari ito sa marami sa aking mga kliyente.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.89,0:21:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Naririnig mo ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.39,0:21:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama na.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.56,0:21:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya okay ka lang. ayos ka lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.23,0:21:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus. Magaling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.94,0:21:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Halika rito. Hayaan mong yakapin kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat nagkunwari kang inosente,\Ndahil kumikilos ka pa rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,"Walang anuman ang divorce papers."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.79,0:21:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nagsasanay lang akong\Nmaging abogado ng diborsiyo."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka ba nakapag-improvised?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Siguradong galit na galit siya. I'll bet\Nmas nakakatakot siya ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you're dispirited.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Available para sa Buwanang Rent{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.51,0:21:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagsumikap ka sa pagpapanggap na in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat wala kang pag-asa ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mali ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.10,0:21:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Anong ibig mong sabihin?\N- Hindi siya galit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.89,0:21:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Talaga?\N- Tama,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.35,0:21:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,at hindi ako nawawalan ng pag-asa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.81,0:22:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- Naiinis ako.\N- Hay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.06,0:22:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala ka sa posisyon na makaramdam ng ganoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.86,0:22:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Umiiyak si Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.61,0:22:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginawa niya,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.44,0:22:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,at nabaliw ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.78,0:22:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,nakikita siyang umiiyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.33,0:22:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano sa mundo...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.12,0:22:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,ginawa ko ba sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.21,0:22:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong meron sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.21,0:22:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Akala ko hindi niya kakayanin na nasa tabi niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,May nararamdaman ba siya para sa kanya, o ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.05,0:22:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So ano ang susunod mong galaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.97,0:22:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- Anong galaw?\N- Wala ka bang plano?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.31,0:22:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,May pinaplano siguro siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Syempre siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.19,0:22:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagalit ka sa kanya ng big-time, kaya't pipiliin kong iniisip niya ang pinakamahusay na paraan...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.65,0:22:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,upang maghiganti.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.94,0:22:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Eksakto.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.57,0:22:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dapat siya.\N- Anong ibig mong sabihin?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.15,0:22:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan niya ang motivation na iyon.\NShe needs to focus on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya sinasadya mong hayaan siyang\Nmag-focus sa pagkasira ng buhay mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.03,0:22:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakripisyo ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.37,0:22:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ba ay isang sundalong tumatakbo sa isang talunan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.33,0:23:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kung mangyari ulit ito,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.87,0:23:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}huwag mo akong iligtas.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.46,0:23:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito lang ang paraan para mabuhay siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.82,0:23:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.40,0:23:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo ginawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.53,0:23:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Papunta na ako para makita ang iyong\Ngrandfather. Mag-usap tayo mamaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.28,0:23:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako pa rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.95,0:23:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano ang ibig mong sabihin?\N- Subukan mo lahat ng gusto mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.83,0:23:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit ang tagapagmana ay palaging ako!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.33,0:23:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo pa rin gets?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.08,0:23:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ganyan ka ba nagseselos sa akin,\Npara guguluhin mo ang kwarto niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.59,0:23:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang malaman ang lahat ng\Npag-uusap na nararanasan natin?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.67,0:23:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi ko ginawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.13,0:23:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi ko na-bug ang kwarto niya.\N- I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.13,0:23:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kunin kung ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.84,0:23:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong nakahanda ka sa\Nisang bagay kapag nagtiis ka...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.72,0:23:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,sa lahat ng ginawa ni Hae-in,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.18,0:24:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,pero ano ngayon? Nahuli ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.02,0:24:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I was planning to give you something\Nonce this resort deal became a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.32,0:24:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"Dapat akong mag-set up ng branch sa Yufuin o Cancún,"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.11,0:24:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"at ipadala siya doon."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.41,0:24:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hindi, masyadong malapit si Yufuin."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.57,0:24:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"Kailangan lang lumipad ni Hae-in ng isang oras."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.83,0:24:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"Dapat siyang pumunta sa Cancún kung gusto niya ng kalayaan."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.95,0:24:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ganyan ako nag-alala sayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.34,0:24:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.34,0:24:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan mong ihinto ang pagtatayo ng resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.96,0:24:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ipinakilala ng consulting firm na si Mr. Yoon...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.51,0:24:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,naghula ng taunang tubo na $500 milyon,\Nngunit ang aktwal na bilang ay $89 milyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.85,0:24:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mababa pa sa 20%. Hindi ba kakaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.26,0:24:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumirma ka sa kontrata\Hindi pa man bago ang validity test...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.23,0:24:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinisikap mong humarang muli!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.27,0:24:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-alala tungkol sa aking tagumpay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.49,0:24:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kalimutan! Ito ay magiging akin!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.41,0:25:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na sa pag-aalala sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.92,0:25:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, ipaliwanag mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.29,0:25:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo itinago ang divorce papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.71,0:25:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Surpresahin mo ba kami nito mamaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.42,0:25:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ba ang dahilan kung bakit mo nitpick\Nang aking mga salita at sinusuway ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.76,0:25:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahil lang sa mga papel na iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.60,0:25:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, gusto po kayong makita ng chairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.51,0:25:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.60,0:25:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pakiiwan lahat ng iyong electronics sa labas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.52,0:25:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, gawin mo iyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.06,0:25:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari kang nagre-record kahit ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.75,0:25:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ipinangako sa iyo ni Chairman Yeom?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.25,0:25:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sorry?\N- Yung divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.59,0:25:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala akong pakialam dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.84,0:25:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinili mong sirain ang iyong suwerte.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.78,0:25:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.84,0:25:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero kung na-bug mo ang kwarto ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.22,0:26:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,at ipinasa ni Chairman Yeom si\Nit sa prosekusyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.72,0:26:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako papayag.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.10,0:26:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-schema ka rin ba sa paglustay ni Mr. Song?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.48,0:26:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinatarget mo ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.31,0:26:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Totoo na ang panghoholdap\N ay naka-target sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.82,0:26:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Naglalaro ka ba ng matalino sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.48,0:26:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinatanong ko kung ikaw ang nasa likod nito!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.41,0:26:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Inaprubahan ni Director Jo Hyeon-myeong\NMr. Mga file ng paglustay ng kanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.12,0:26:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang lalaking katabi niya ay nasa\Ncharge ng external audit ng Queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.97,0:26:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya si Hwang Byeong-u na\Nmay sariling accounting firm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.46,0:26:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- Parehas silang college.\N- Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.38,0:26:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagsasagawa siya ng taunang pag-audit,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.88,0:26:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya nakakapagtaka na wala siyang nakitang isyu hanggang ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.38,0:26:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,May kanyang accounting firm...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.76,0:26:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,talagang hindi alam ng Mr. Song's\Nembezzlement sa nakalipas na limang taon?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.86,0:26:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kaya sinasabi mo sa akin si Jo Hyeon-myeong\Nschemed sa kanyang firm,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.90,0:27:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}at pumikit sa panghoholdap?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.32,0:27:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kaya ako ay iimbestigahan?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.24,0:27:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hindi, sir.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.41,0:27:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito ginawa ni Director Jo\Nalone. May nag-utos sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.08,0:27:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Naniniwala akong na-bug ng indibidwal ang iyong\Nroom at itinanim ang transmitter sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.46,0:27:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,At sino ang taong ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.64,0:27:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko pa alam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.18,0:27:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.22,0:27:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka pa sigurado,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.39,0:27:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}pero gusto mong paniwalaan kita pagkatapos\Nano ang ginawa mo sa apo ko?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.27,0:27:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kayo ba?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.60,0:27:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Direktor Jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.73,0:27:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat kang magmadali.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.07,0:27:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit? Dahil hinahabol ka ni Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.33,0:27:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mga Tinantyang Asset $2,386.69{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.42,0:28:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-stock ka na naman?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.17,0:28:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Magulo ang market.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.55,0:28:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mahalaga kung gaano ka-blue,\Nas long as my baby is red.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.35,0:28:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Queens Department Store{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.10,0:28:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ito ay pula.\N- Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.44,0:28:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sino ang baby mo?\N- Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.48,0:28:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Halika. Sabihin mo sa akin.\N- Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.36,0:28:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.98,0:28:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Itigil mo na yan!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.36,0:28:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nababaliw ka na ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.94,0:28:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumili ka ng stocks ng Queens?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.07,0:28:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Papatayin ako ni Mama, kaya tumahimik ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.82,0:28:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo bibilhin ang mga ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.79,0:28:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Meron ako noon, pero ibinenta ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.37,0:28:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kailan?\N- Nung binanggit ni Hyun-woo yung divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.42,0:28:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko mabalewala ang panganib ng may-ari.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.67,0:28:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang magandang lalabas sa\Npagbanggit ng media sa kanilang hiwalayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.43,0:28:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang tuso mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.34,0:28:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapos binili mo ulit sila nung\NHyun-woo ay nagpasya na hindi hiwalayan?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.30,0:28:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama. Tingnan ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.31,0:28:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tataas na diba?\N- Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.10,0:28:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.52,0:28:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibang-iba sa iyo na umidlip.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.57,0:29:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagkaroon ako ng masamang panaginip.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.73,0:29:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh.\N- Tungkol saan ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.57,0:29:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay hindi maliwanag.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.78,0:29:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano iyon? Marahil ito ay isang panaginip ng paglilihi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.22,0:29:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatay ni Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.28,0:29:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ganoon kaganda.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.84,0:29:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Nanay{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.55,0:29:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hello?\N- Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.72,0:29:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba ito ang telepono ni Mr. Baek Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.18,0:29:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, ito nga.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.64,0:29:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ang nanay ni Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.73,0:29:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta, Ms. Kim. kamusta ka na?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.27,0:29:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Naiwan yata ni Hyun-woo ang phone niya,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.86,0:29:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- {\i1}pero bakit ikaw...?{\i0}\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.32,0:29:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikipag-usap siya sa aking biyenan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.40,0:29:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hindi ko alam kung alam mo,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.11,0:29:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,pero binaligtad ni Hyun-woo ang pamilya namin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.74,0:29:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? anong nangyari?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.16,0:29:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Na-bug ang kwarto ng biyenan ko...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.21,0:29:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kalimutan ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.75,0:30:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam mo bang gusto ni Hyun-woo ng divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.05,0:30:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nabanggit na niya dati,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.09,0:30:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}pero normal lang sa mag-asawa...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.35,0:30:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,upang dumaan sa magaspang na patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.09,0:30:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Akala ko naresolba na nila ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.60,0:30:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam niya ang tungkol sa diborsyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.68,0:30:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.73,0:30:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat marinig mo muna sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.65,0:30:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sinabi mo sa akin na huwag akong hadlangan...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.61,0:30:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,sa araw na ikinasal sila,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.44,0:30:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,pero makikita mo, sisiguraduhin kong maghihiwalay sila,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.24,0:30:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kaya huwag kang humarang sa akin.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.82,0:30:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay, ano ang sinabi niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.33,0:30:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang gagawin ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.70,0:30:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan. Anong gagawin ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.54,0:30:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kapani-paniwala.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.00,0:30:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.01,0:30:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Magulo ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.89,0:30:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano kung makipagdivorce talaga siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.31,0:31:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang kulit mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.69,0:31:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ibenta{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.40,0:31:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kumpleto na ang iyong order{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.19,0:31:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibinenta ko sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.19,0:31:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito kumplikado.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.90,0:31:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gawin mo lang ang ginawa nila sa mga mansanas.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.74,0:31:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Maaaring kumagat si Hong sa iyong peras at sabihin,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.41,0:31:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sus, ang sweet."\NTYun lang ang kailangan niyang gawin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.54,0:31:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat humingi ulit ako ng tulong sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.04,0:31:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya dapat ang tumulong sa atin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.13,0:31:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sila ang nagsamantala.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.38,0:31:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang iyong opinyon tungkol dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.09,0:31:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay hindi kapani-paniwala...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.92,0:31:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,na naglaan siya ng oras para bumaba dito at mag-flex,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.89,0:31:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,at gusto mong humingi ulit ng tulong sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.01,0:31:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito magiging madali.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.18,0:31:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Eksakto.\N- Masisiraan ka ng mukha.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.81,0:31:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.35,0:31:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapos hahayaan mo bang kunin ni Park Seok-hun ang lahat?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.81,0:31:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Palagi kang extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.23,0:31:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,INFP ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.53,0:31:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig mong sabihin? Ako si Park Chun-sik.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.78,0:31:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinag-uusapan ko ang tungkol sa iyong mga layunin.\NGagawin mo ba ang lahat para maabot ang mga ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.87,0:31:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,O mas mahalaga ba ang proseso?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.58,0:32:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,INFP o ENFJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.04,0:32:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung ganoon...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.67,0:32:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Isa akong INFP.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.30,0:32:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay pakainin siya ng peras\Nand sabihin sa kanya na magkomento dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.26,0:32:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan muna nating alisin ang\Nvideo ng pagkain niya ng mansanas.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.80,0:32:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung ayaw mong ninakaw ng mga kaaway ang iyong pagkain,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.85,0:32:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- huwag ilagay ang table sa harap nila.\N- Iyan ay may katuturan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.56,0:32:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tay, bakit hindi ka na nagsusundo?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.48,0:32:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ubos na ang baterya. Natutuwa akong nandito ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.31,0:32:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibaba ang video na iyon ni Hae-in na kumakain ng mansanas.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.98,0:32:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Meron na ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.11,0:32:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi iyon ang isyu. Mayroon akong masamang balita.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.40,0:32:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.70,0:32:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.49,0:32:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Malalaman mo lahat sa huli.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.91,0:32:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.42,0:32:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan. Anong gagawin natin?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.34,0:32:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghihiwalay na sila?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.75,0:32:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyeon-tae, may anxiety pills ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.09,0:32:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Syempre hindi.\N- Hindi yun ang problema.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.93,0:32:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat niyang malampasan ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.55,0:32:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.47,0:33:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakaaliw ba ito para sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.14,0:33:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita mo, gusto kong gamitin ang Dr. Oh's\Nsolution sa sitwasyong ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.31,0:33:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Episode 58, yung kay Nancy Lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.90,0:33:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Nabanggit ni Oh ang tatlong hakbang\Nupang malampasan ang hirap sa buhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.03,0:33:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nakita ko, pero nakalimutan ko.\N- Step one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.97,0:33:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Acknowledgement.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.03,0:33:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumpak na suriin ang kasalukuyang krisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.70,0:33:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibinigay ba nila ang divorce papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.49,0:33:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin ko ay hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.71,0:33:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikalawang Hakbang. Pagkamulat sa sarili.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.33,0:33:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Alamin kung gaano kalala ang sitwasyon\Nand kung gaano ito kalala.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.67,0:33:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayroon bang mga artikulo o tabloid?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.96,0:33:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi pa, pero sandali lang, tama?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.76,0:33:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.76,0:33:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,At panghuli, pag-aayos nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.85,0:33:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Magpasya kung ano ang isusuko mo sa\Nand kung ano ang pananatilihin mo. Pagkatapos ay kumilos dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.06,0:33:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino na ang bahala sa eleksyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.31,0:33:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kalimutan ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.94,0:33:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- Saan ka pupunta?\N- Nasaan ang mama mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.57,0:33:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakaalis niya. Hindi ko alam kung saan siya nagpunta.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.07,0:34:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan mo bang banggitin ang halalan ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.03,0:34:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.12,0:34:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Isa akong INTP.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.83,0:34:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Yongdu-ri Supermarket{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.63,0:34:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang sinasabi niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.71,0:34:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ng nanay ni Hyun-woo ang lahat at nagsinungaling sa amin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.22,0:34:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare they upload that video\Nof Hae-in, when she knew nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.05,0:34:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kalmado.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.18,0:34:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Maging mahinahon bilang kanyang ina.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.97,0:34:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine kung ano ang nararamdaman ni Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.89,0:34:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Seon-hwa!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.52,0:34:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nangyayari?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.60,0:34:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginawa ba talaga ni Hyun-woo yun?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.15,0:34:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Lagi mo siyang pinagtatanggol.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.73,0:34:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang sinabi ko sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.15,0:34:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakahirap mong judge ng pagkatao.\NO nakakapagtaka na palagi kang pinagtaksilan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.20,0:34:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mo akong sisihin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.03,0:34:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Palagi kang malilinlang kung\Walang taong determinadong linlangin ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.79,0:34:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Bakit hindi ko dapat sabihin kahit kanino?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.48,0:34:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ang babaeng iyon ay\Nlinlangin kami nang mahigit 20 taon!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.68,0:34:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Eksakto.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.75,0:34:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Patunay lang iyon kung gaano siya kabangis.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.55,0:34:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kung wala kang patunay,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.59,0:35:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}itatanggi niya lang ito at gagawin kang tanga.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.05,0:35:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pagpasensyahan natin. Siya ay may anak na lalaki,\Nkaya dapat ay pinadalhan niya ito ng pera.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.01,0:35:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hanapin muna natin siya.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.31,0:35:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Samantala, panatilihing kontrolado ang iyong init ng ulo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.48,0:35:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Dapat.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako maka-relate,\Ndahil hindi ako nanay,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.07,0:35:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,pero muli, sa palagay ko ganoon din sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.08,0:35:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo kailangang maging nanay para maka-relate.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.75,0:35:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Naiisip ko kung ano ang nararamdaman niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.67,0:35:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Gayunpaman, mag-isip nang dalawang beses tungkol sa diborsyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.33,0:35:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong nagbago ang panahon,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.54,0:35:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,pero mas magdurusa si Hae-in\Nsa kanya kung maghiwalay sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.88,0:35:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kunin mo siya, halimbawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.97,0:35:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka nakatingin sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.14,0:35:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi tulad ng kanyang mga dating asawa\Nna lahat ay masayang nagpakasal muli,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.22,0:35:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Single pa rin si Beom-ja.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.89,0:35:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig mong sabihin?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.14,0:35:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-asawa din ako kaagad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.19,0:35:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,At naghiwalay ka kaagad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.27,0:35:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Seon-hwa, hindi yan ang problema ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.23,0:35:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan si Hae-in? Anong ginagawa niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.99,0:36:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, hirap na hirap na siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.49,0:36:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Nahihirapan na siya?\NIMay nangyayari ba sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.00,0:36:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.12,0:36:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,, Workaholic lang siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.00,0:36:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan niyang huminga. Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.13,0:36:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.13,0:36:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang sinasabi niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.64,0:37:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayan. pinirmahan ko rin,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.31,0:37:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,pero nasa sa akin kung kailan at paano ko ito isusumite.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.69,0:37:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.32,0:37:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa wakas naiintindihan ko na kung bakit...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.03,0:37:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,, binugbog ng tiyahin ko ang mga dating asawa\Nto sa isang pulpol bago ang diborsyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.70,0:37:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kukunin ko ang higit na karampatang\Nattorneys kaysa sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.90,0:37:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka aalis sa bahay na ito nang hindi nasaktan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.53,0:37:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sisipain ka nang walang awa.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.37,0:37:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.12,0:37:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Naiintindihan ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.43,0:37:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit mangyaring panatilihin ang iyong\Ndistansya mula kay Yoon Eun-sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.31,0:37:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.31,0:37:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Na-out of touch siya ng matagal\Ntime tapos biglang sumulpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.65,0:38:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay binigyan ka niya ng isang mabigat na pamumuhunan,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.77,0:38:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,at ang Hercyna deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.78,0:38:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat may motibo siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.07,0:38:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Naghihinala din siya.\N- Paano?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.99,0:38:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,May footage ng dashcam\Nof the hunting-ground incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.20,0:38:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibinigay ko ang SD card sa isang\Ndata-restoration company.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.83,0:38:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Binisita sila ni Yoon,\Nand nawala ang may-ari.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.88,0:38:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Paano iyon nagpapatunay ng anuman?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.84,0:38:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay maaaring isa pang kliyente,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.55,0:38:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,at kahit na mayroon siyang isang bagay sa kanyang manggas,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.05,0:38:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,hindi niya ako lolokohin ng ganun kadali.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.06,0:38:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero ginawa ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.15,0:38:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag lang gumawa ng parehong pagkakamali.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.55,0:39:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Naghanda kami ng pine\Nmushroom porridge para sa almusal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.51,0:39:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gusto mo ba?\N- Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.80,0:39:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto ko ng beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.20,0:40:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Nabulag ako ng diamond necklace ni Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.00,0:40:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayroon kaming peacock at large.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.54,0:40:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Brace yourselves.\N- Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.13,0:40:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na, pero anong peacock?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.96,0:40:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama. Newbie ka dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.38,0:40:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang hitsura ni Ms. Hong?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.84,0:40:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Maganda.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.84,0:40:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Totoo iyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.09,0:40:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, tandaan mo lang ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.14,0:40:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung mas galit siya, mas maganda ang kanyang pananamit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.35,0:40:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukha siyang kamangha-manghang peacock ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.81,0:40:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibig sabihin patay na karne tayong lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.06,0:40:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon ano ang dapat nating gawin?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.65,0:40:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,May...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.32,0:40:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}walang solusyon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.78,0:40:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mga natural na sakuna at pagiging sumpungin ni Ms. Hong\Nare dalawang bagay na hindi kayang kontrolin ng tao.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.20,0:41:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, pasensya na!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.79,0:41:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ireprint kong muli ang mga dokumentong ito, at...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.67,0:41:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.44,0:41:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.53,0:41:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ginawa mo...?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.59,0:41:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang. Hindi ito life-or-death na sitwasyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.22,0:41:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kang magdamdam tungkol sa pagtapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.26,0:41:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang. Maaari kang pumunta.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.64,0:41:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong, galit ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.52,0:41:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, mayroon akong mas ikinagalit sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.19,0:41:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.23,0:41:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.40,0:41:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kahit ang palpak na ulat na ito...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.28,0:41:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,ay hindi nagagalit sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.95,0:41:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakatakot siya, kahit na hindi galit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.08,0:41:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder kung ano ang ikinagagalit niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.54,0:41:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Galing kami sa audit team.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.84,0:41:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagsasagawa kami ng imbestigasyon...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.71,0:41:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,pagkatapos makatanggap ng ulat sa\Niligal na paggamit ng mga gastos.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.76,0:41:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mangyaring tumayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.85,0:42:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag gutayin ang anumang mga dokumento.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.18,0:42:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag sirain o ilipat ang anuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.99,0:42:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, ito ay kabuuang pagdanak ng dugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.66,0:42:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagsimula na ba ang Hong-Baek Battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.95,0:42:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay magiging isang sakuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.29,0:42:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tara na.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.84,0:42:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Lahat sila?\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.13,0:42:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tatanggihan mo sila?\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.80,0:42:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit kinumpirma mo na\N sila bago pumunta sa Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.51,0:42:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.18,0:42:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Lahat sila?\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.77,0:42:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,, Tinanggihan niya silang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.52,0:42:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Karaniwan itong tumatagal ng isang linggo.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.56,0:42:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang tagal ay hindi ang problema sa pagkakataong ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.36,0:42:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang intensity ay nasa ibang level.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.69,0:42:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano sa mundo ang nangyari sa Germany?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.86,0:42:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibahagi natin ang kanilang mga iskedyul.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.86,0:42:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag hayaan silang magkabanggaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.53,0:43:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? Ang lunch meeting. Kumakain din kami ng sushi sa J Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.53,0:43:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Baguhin ito. Susundin ko ang iyong\Niskedyul para sa mga pagsakay sa elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.62,0:43:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.87,0:43:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.38,0:43:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Queens Department Store Inc.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.99,0:43:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nasuri na namin ang mga kontrata\Npara sa malapit nang magsara na mga tindahan,"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.15,0:43:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"para makapagpatuloy ka."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.17,0:43:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"Napag-usapan na natin ito,\Nkaya hindi mo na ito mababago."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.06,0:43:30.04,Default,,0,0,0, "Kailangan mong magbayad ng triple\Nang penalty fee kung gagawin mo."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.06,0:43:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,"Paki-apruba ito, para makapagpatuloy tayo."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.78,0:43:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"Paalam, kung gayon."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.36,0:43:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yun ang sabi niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.07,0:43:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ang legal team na ang bahala sa\Nmga isyu sa penalty. Hindi ko ito maaaprubahan."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.70,0:43:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hindi ka ba dapat umakyat..."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.70,0:43:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,"na may iba't ibang mga sitwasyon\Nregarding sa mga posibleng isyu,"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.54,0:43:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"patakbuhin ang mga simulation, at pagkatapos\Niulat ang mga ito sa akin? Muli."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.17,0:43:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon ang sinabi niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.13,0:43:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- How feisty.\N- Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.76,0:43:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi bale.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.63,0:44:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Diba may sushi tayo ngayon sa J Hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.30,0:44:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tara na.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.47,0:44:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta naman ang Chinese restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.43,0:44:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.06,0:44:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Malaki ang halaga para sa ating lahat\Nang magkaroon ng sushi {\i1}omakase.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.85,0:44:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang. Ito ang aking treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.94,0:44:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ko kung gaano ka nagsumikap.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.07,0:44:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Intsik na lang natin sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.28,0:44:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Masarap ang kanilang sweet-and-sour\Npork lunch set.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.24,0:44:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit biglaan?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.70,0:44:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,May iba pa bang dahilan?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.70,0:44:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.00,0:44:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas gusto nilang lahat na magkaroon ng Chinese sa halip.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.67,0:44:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Anong meron sa mukha ni Mr. Kim?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.13,0:44:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Papatayin niya tayo kung pipiliin natin ang sushi.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.26,0:44:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Pustahan ako dahil pupunta doon si Ms. Hong.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.26,0:44:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Sa tingin ko ay naintindihan ito ni Mr. Baek.\NAKAisip kong mahal niya{\i0} jajangmyeon.{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.06,0:44:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Nakakaaliw ito.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.27,0:44:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Wala akong pakialam kung ano ang meron kami.\NI gusto lang manood ng mayayaman na nagtatalo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.44,0:44:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ako rin ako rin{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.40,0:44:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ang Kuwago ay lumipat sa Chinese.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.23,0:45:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Okay. Ang Agila ay patungo sa\Nelebeytor sa Building A.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.61,0:45:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ang Kuwago ay patungo sa Building B.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.91,0:45:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gabi na. Punta tayo sa Building B.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.04,0:45:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit malapit na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.00,0:45:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Nagbago ang takbo ng Agila.\NLalapit sa Building B sa loob ng tatlong minuto.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.09,0:45:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Maglakad na lang ba tayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.18,0:45:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Napakalusog na umakyat sa hagdan.\N- Hindi kung bababa ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.15,0:45:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Emergency.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.15,0:45:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ms. Papunta dito si Hong! Tulong!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.33,0:45:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasa chatroom din ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.46,0:45:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.30,0:46:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat magkasama kayong kumakain sa labas.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.64,0:46:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala kang masyadong gagawin.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.60,0:46:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinatrato ko sila, since\Nmarami silang trabaho.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.22,0:46:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.48,0:46:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat kang gumawa ng mas mahusay,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.02,0:46:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,at habang ginagawa mo ito,\Bigyan mo ako ng ulat ng pagsusuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.60,0:46:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,sa mga kaso na paulit-ulit mong natalo...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.28,0:46:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,sa nakalipas na tatlong taon,\Nand alamin kung paano pagbutihin.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.32,0:46:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.74,0:46:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,pero kapag nirepaso mo ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.03,0:46:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sana iwanan mo ang anumang\Npersonal na nararamdaman mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.53,0:46:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo yata alam.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.95,0:46:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty much an AI...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.37,0:46:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,pagdating sa trabaho,\Nkaya huwag kang mag-alala tungkol diyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.91,0:46:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Talaga? hindi ko alam.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.62,0:46:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yung kamangmangan mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.00,0:46:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,ang dahilan kung bakit patuloy kang natatalo sa mga kasong iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.74,0:47:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat ba tayong umakyat sa hagdan?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.66,0:47:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sige.\N- Tara na.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.46,0:47:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nabasa mo ba ang balita?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.59,0:47:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang bagong biotechnology ng NSFA ay gawa-gawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.42,0:47:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Namuhunan kami sa kanila.\N- Ginamit mo ba ang iyong shares bilang collateral?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.80,0:47:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Imposibleng makuha ang pera sa cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.43,0:47:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Pumirma pa ako ng foreclosure\Nagreement sa bangko.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.43,0:47:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ako rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.27,0:47:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Paano kung kumpiskahin ng bangko ang ating mga share?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.15,0:47:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Maaabot mo ba si Direk Jo?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.61,0:47:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, nakakalungkot makita kang umalis.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.19,0:47:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Napakadaling lumaki sa akin ang mga tao.\N- Manatiling malusog.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.49,0:47:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Magagalak ang iyong mga anak na makita ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.24,0:47:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Lalo pa, dahil mayaman ka na ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.53,0:47:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagsisimula na naman ako, kaya't marami akong mabubuting gawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.08,0:48:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,at tumulong sa iba.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.58,0:48:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.96,0:48:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang batas ng mga limitasyon...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.46,0:48:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,para sa pandaraya sa pananalapi na\N$100,000 o higit pa ay 25 taon.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.46,0:48:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka makakatulong sa iba kung ikaw ay nasa bilangguan,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.13,0:48:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya huwag kang mahuli.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.76,0:48:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pusta ka. Mananatili akong malayo sa\NKorean mart at restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.51,0:48:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mabubuhay ako ng maayos.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.73,0:48:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Paalam, kung gayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.73,0:48:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakaruming hamak.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.73,0:48:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano siya naging bastos, pagkatapos ng pagsuso\Nang kanyang mga matagal nang kasamahan ay tuyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.11,0:48:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Paalam. Sige na.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.70,0:48:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong dirtbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.72,0:48:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Sungmin University Medical Center{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.82,0:49:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.54,0:49:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hae-in.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.31,0:49:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Makipag-ugnayan sa Sungmin Medical Center.\NI may kailangang suriin.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.56,0:49:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, Mr. Baek.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.65,0:49:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta ka na? Ano ang nagdadala sa iyo dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.77,0:49:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,May tanong ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.19,0:49:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikilala mo ba ang relo na ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.32,0:49:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.07,0:50:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang limitadong edisyon para sa ika-101 anibersaryo ni Ronde\Nde Frédic.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.37,0:50:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 101 lang ang ginawa.\N- I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.74,0:50:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit ang isang ito ay na-pre-order.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.04,0:50:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita mo ba itong dilaw na brilyante?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.71,0:50:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Idinagdag lang ang brilyante na ito sa\Ndial ng sampung na-pre-order na relo.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.59,0:50:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong marami itong itatanong,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.05,0:50:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,pero pwede ko bang malaman kung sino ang bumili ng sampung relo na iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.59,0:50:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, matutulungan kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.01,0:50:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinulungan mo ang aking ina na malutas\Nang insidente ng malpractice sa medisina.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.56,0:50:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Malapit ako sa team leader ng HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.64,0:50:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-alala.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.92,0:50:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.98,0:50:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Liliko ako ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.65,0:50:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumingin sa malayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.81,0:50:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dahan-dahan.\N- Mabuti.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.82,0:50:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ituwid ang iyong likod.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.98,0:50:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Itapak ang pedal. yun lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.53,0:50:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, turn. Oo, dahan-dahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.45,0:50:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahan-dahan. Mabuti iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.37,0:50:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,, Lumiko nang maayos.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.41,0:50:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ganito?\N- Oo, tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.16,0:50:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ang galing mo.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.25,0:50:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakagaling mo. Beginner ka ba talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.50,0:50:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko kailangan itong mga dagdag na gulong,\Nngunit patuloy siyang nagpumilit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.67,0:50:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Kilala mo siya, di ba? Isa siyang bronze medalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.67,0:51:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oo.\N- Dapat makinig ako sa pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.05,0:51:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginagamit ng lahat ang mga gulong ng pagsasanay sa simula.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.01,0:51:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Lilipad ako nang wala sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.02,0:51:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Panoorin mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.68,0:51:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll go faster.\N- Okay, pero relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.10,0:51:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahan-dahan. yun lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.98,0:51:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ganito?\N- Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.52,0:51:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumunta sa isang tuwid na linya.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.36,0:51:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.78,0:51:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, anak ko! Soo-cheol!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.36,0:51:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, mahal!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.12,0:51:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagdudugo ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.29,0:51:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit hindi niyo siya pinigilan?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.87,0:51:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit kailangan nila?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.37,0:51:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo ba nakikita ang lahat ng dumi at semento na ito?\NBakit ka sasakay dito? Ito ay mapanganib.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.71,0:51:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- Huwag kang sumakay dito.\N- Halika na, Nay!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.13,0:51:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Skateboards, bisikleta, skis,\Nrollerblades, at kick scooter.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.01,0:51:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko kayang sakyan ang alinman sa kanila dahil sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.14,0:51:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo man lang ako pinasakay ng matarik\Nslide, kaya wala akong karanasan.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.73,0:51:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahil baka mahulog ka...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.65,0:51:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Eksakto. Never pa akong nahulog.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.52,0:51:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.57,0:51:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngayon naiintindihan mo na ba kung gaano ako nagmahal sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.24,0:52:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit kailangan mong mahulog?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.32,0:52:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.66,0:52:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bilang tatay niya,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.74,0:52:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat turuan ko man lang\NGeon-u kung paano sumakay ng bisikleta.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.04,0:52:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So turuan mo lang ang anak mo kung paano sumakay?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.54,0:52:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kaya lang?\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.62,0:52:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuturuan ko siya...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.50,0:52:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,paano sumakay ng bisikleta,\Nrollerblades, kick scooter,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.50,0:52:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,mga skateboard, at ski.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.51,0:52:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari kang kumuha ng magtuturo sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.76,0:52:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo ilalagay ang iyong sarili sa panganib ng ganoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.76,0:52:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat ituro ng mga ama\Nsa kanilang mga anak ang mga bagay na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.06,0:52:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sisimulan ko na.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.14,0:52:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sige.\N- Hindi, Soo-cheol. babagsak ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.77,0:52:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Soo-cheol...\N- Mr. Kim, ilipat mo na ang sasakyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.94,0:52:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nay, halika na.\N- Bumaba ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.11,0:52:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ilipat ang sasakyan, kung hindi, mabangga ko ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.86,0:52:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.91,0:52:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kumusta, ito si Kevin mula sa Manhattan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.16,0:52:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.16,0:52:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tungkol ito sa Upper West Side\Napartment. Gusto itong ibenta ng may-ari.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.17,0:52:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Maganda iyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.50,0:53:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pagkatapos ay magpapatuloy ako. Magiging wasto ang kontrata hanggang sa katapusan ng buwan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.88,0:53:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nandito ka ba?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.97,0:53:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kailangan mong pirmahan ito mismo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.68,0:53:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Dalawang linggo na ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.93,0:53:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, meron po\Nodd nalaman ko si Mr. Baek.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.94,0:53:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.31,0:53:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Patuloy niyang tinatawag ang pangalan ng isang babae sa rooftop garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.94,0:53:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Pangalan ng babae?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.58,0:53:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Yeong-suk.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.96,0:53:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Yeong-suk?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.60,0:53:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Yeong...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.39,0:53:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Lumabas kung nandito ka.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.48,0:54:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeong-suk ang pangalan niya.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.57,0:54:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yun?\N- Paulit-ulit niyang sinasabi sa kanya na lumabas.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.90,0:54:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kalimutan ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.74,0:54:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kilala ko ang pangalang iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.49,0:54:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.90,0:54:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,May nahanap ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.86,0:54:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Binabantayan naming mabuti ang\NMr. Baek sa buong orasan kamakailan.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.15,0:54:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang ginagawa niya bawat oras.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.87,0:54:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi tipikal ang mga lugar na pinuntahan niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.75,0:54:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano na naman ang ginawa niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.50,0:55:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? "Barya baseball"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.88,0:55:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, limang bola sa halagang 50 cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.88,0:55:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Palagi siyang pumupunta doon pagkatapos ng trabaho.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.80,0:55:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kasama kanino?\N- Mag-isa.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.43,0:55:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kalimutan mo na ito. Susunod.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.89,0:55:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang "Lola's Home Cooking"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.35,0:55:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagtitinda sila ng mga lutong bahay.\Nakakaroon siya ng hapunan araw-araw.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.15,0:55:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kasama kanino?\N- Mag-isa.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.11,0:55:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sinubukan ko ang kanilang pagkain para sa layunin ng pananaliksik.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.78,0:55:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Masarap. Pupunta rin ako doon mag-isa.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.07,0:55:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit siya kikilos nang kaawa-awa at kakain mag-isa?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.70,0:55:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Puwede siyang kumain palagi sa bahay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.41,0:55:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano mga dalawang araw ang nakalipas?\Numauwi siya ng hatinggabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.21,0:55:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama. Nag-enjoy siya ng baboy {\i1}bulgogi...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.05,0:55:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,sa Home Cooking ni Lola para sa hapunan,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.63,0:55:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,bumili ng dalawang bote ng tubig sa isang convenience store,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.74,0:55:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,at nagpunta sa malapit na elementarya.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.80,0:55:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa oras na iyon? Ito ba ay isang lihim na pagkikita?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.89,0:55:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, nag-iisa lang siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.97,0:55:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano ang ginawa niya doon mag-isa?\N- Tumakbo siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.31,0:56:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tumakbo siya?\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.77,0:56:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam mong pinaparusahan ng mga guro ang kanilang\Nmga mag-aaral sa pamamagitan ng pagpapa-laps sa kanila.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.15,0:56:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon ang ginagawa niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.86,0:56:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- What for?\N- Tinalo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.28,0:56:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi naman siya athlete,\Npero kumanta pa siya at sumigaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.24,0:56:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Medyo natakot ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.08,0:56:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang makita?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.59,0:56:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,♫ {\i1}Huwag mo akong tanungin kung bakit ako aalis{\i0} ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.97,0:56:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,♫ {\i1}Ako ay{\i0} ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.80,0:56:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,♫ {\i1}ganyan katanga{\i0} ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.43,0:56:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano bang problema niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.81,0:56:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabi ko sa iyo, sir. Hindi siya tipikal.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.90,0:56:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakasalubong niya ang isang pusang gala habang pauwi.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.23,0:56:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nag-hello siya at binigyan ito ng meryenda.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.82,0:56:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hindi ko inaasahan ang isang mistress,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.44,0:56:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,pero inaasahan kong makakita ng ilang tycoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.45,0:56:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagawa mo ba nang maayos ang iyong trabaho?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.16,0:56:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayokong magyabang, pero kita mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.95,0:57:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so competent, I can locate\Na target even in North Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.62,0:57:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Totoo iyan. Napaka-tenacious niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.83,0:57:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bilang legal na direktor ng Queens,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.50,0:57:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,may pusa lang ang nakatagpo niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.46,0:57:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Aeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.00,0:57:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano?\N- Pangalan ng pusa.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.92,0:57:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang pinakamabangis\Ncat sa kapitbahayan na ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.09,0:57:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit pinangalanan niya ito, at nakikinig ito sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.55,0:57:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-hire din ako ng dating-CSI\Nhacker para i-hack ang kanyang telepono.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.02,0:57:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Maraming litrato ni Aeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.86,0:57:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakaiba, tama? Pareho kami ng naisip.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.82,0:57:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong klaseng lalaki ang kumukuha ng ganoon kagandang mga larawan\Nong kanyang babae na gusto niyang hiwalayan?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.95,0:57:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung titingnan mong mabuti, ang\Nphoto na ito ay nagpapahaba ng kanyang mga binti.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.33,0:57:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang larawang ito ay nangangailangan ng maraming konsentrasyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.00,0:57:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- This is true love.\N- Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.55,0:58:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala yata siyang babae sa gilid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.56,0:58:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala itong pinatutunayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.73,0:58:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Maraming beses mo na siyang nilagyan ng buntot.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.23,0:58:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Marunong siyang kumilos nang maayos sa mga panahong tulad nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.27,0:58:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.69,0:58:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasabihin ng mga numero.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.82,0:58:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Malapit nang lumabas ang mga resulta ng audit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.49,0:58:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wala talaga silang mahanap.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.70,0:58:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sila ay masusing suriin,\Nmula sa kanyang bayad sa konsulta...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.20,0:58:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,sa mga gastos sa paglilitis, at walang nakita.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.04,0:58:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinuri ko ang mga detalye ng card at account niya,\Nand siya nakakapagtakang hindi siya gumagastos ng malaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.50,0:58:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Madalas lang siyang pumunta sa car wash,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.55,0:58:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- pero...\N- Pero ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.63,0:58:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mag-withdraw siya ng libu-libong\Ndollar na cash paminsan-minsan.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.38,0:58:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- Talaga?\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.35,0:58:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Isa pang kakaiba ay palagi siyang gumagastos ng $300...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.01,0:58:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,sa Moulin Rouge sa araw ng kanyang pag-withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.73,0:58:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Moulin Rouge?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.40,0:58:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- Isang bar?\N- Isang flower shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.16,0:59:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumastos siya ng $300 ngayon at nagpadala ng mga bulaklak sa isang Kim Min-ji.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.92,0:59:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pangalan ng babae iyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.63,0:59:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Naniniwala ako.\N- Nakikita ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.09,0:59:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya bumili siya ng mga bulaklak\Nag-withdraw ng pera si Nand...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.22,0:59:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,bago makilala itong Kim Min-ji?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.35,0:59:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Saan?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.97,0:59:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan siya ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.35,0:59:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kim Min-ji\NGangju-gu, Seoul{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.06,0:59:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mga Anak na Babae\NKim Min-ji{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.69,0:59:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}CEO Hong Hae-in ng Queens Department Store{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.99,0:59:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.00,0:59:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.16,0:59:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ms. Kim Min-ji?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.08,0:59:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Makipag-ugnayan sa aming mga customer lang.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.84,0:59:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumulong na ang kumpanya sa libing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.13,1:00:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Personal mo kaming pinadalhan ng mga bulaklak at\Nagbigay sa amin ng maraming pera ng pakikiramay,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.47,1:00:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,at naglaan ka pa ng oras para bumisita.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.72,1:00:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam kung paano magpasalamat...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.76,1:00:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Mr. Baek yata ay nagpadala ng\Ncondolence flowers sa ilalim ng pangalan mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.77,1:00:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Medyo na-touch ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.31,1:00:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.15,1:00:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Tulad ng ano?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.78,1:01:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Pareho ang lahat ng punerarya,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.49,1:01:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,pero malinis at moderno ang lugar na ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.82,1:01:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi lang mga chrysanthemum ang mayroon,\Nkundi mga dahlias at tulips din.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.08,1:01:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinaliliwanag nito ang silid.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.66,1:01:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mga anghel ba iyon?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.62,1:01:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Rococo style. gusto ko ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.58,1:01:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto ko rin kung paano sila may mga halogen lamp dito,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.50,1:01:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit naka-pin light sa kanyang larawan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.55,1:01:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Naghahanap ka ba ng funeral hall?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.93,1:01:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.22,1:01:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibig kong sabihin, tumitingin-tingin ka sa paligid.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.31,1:01:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakatingin lang ako sa paligid.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.65,1:01:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.52,1:01:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang tagal na namin\N nakarating sa isang libing na tulad nito.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.11,1:01:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Karamihan sa mga libing na dinadaluhan namin...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.24,1:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,bihira ang mga miyembro ng pamilya na umiiyak tulad nila.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.04,1:01:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Abala sila sa pagkonsulta sa kanilang\Nattorneys o accountant...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.08,1:01:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,tungkol sa kanilang inheritance o gift tax.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.63,1:02:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanay...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.80,1:02:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.72,1:02:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Talagang nagdadalamhati sila.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.99,1:02:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka nagpadala ng bulaklak...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.33,1:02:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,at ang pera ng pakikiramay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.96,1:02:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ihinto ang paglalaro. Naiinis ka sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.63,1:02:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kahit na mawala ang memorya ko sa daan,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.17,1:02:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko makakalimutan ang ginawa mo sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.01,1:02:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bitiwan mo ang kamay ko noong...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.39,1:02:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,ang pinaka walang magawa.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.18,1:02:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinding-hindi kita mapapatawad.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.14,1:03:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Subukan ang lahat ng gusto mo,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.65,1:03:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,pero magdaramdam ako sayo hanggang sa huling hininga ko,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.90,1:03:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya ang kailangan mo lang gawin...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.74,1:03:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,ay manatiling tahimik...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.49,1:03:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,at mawala kapag sinabi ko sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.10,1:03:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mabilis iyon.\N- Syempre.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.86,1:03:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano yun?\N- Wala lang.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.57,1:03:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ayokong magdagdag ng panggatong sa apoy.\N- Hindi, hayaan mong marinig ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.90,1:03:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.49,1:03:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kilala mo ba si Secretary Kim\Nand medyo naging close ako?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.28,1:03:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakausap lang namin sa phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.48,1:03:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,"Kamusta na sila? Sa tingin mo ba nagkasundo sila?"
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.08,1:04:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"Saan sila pupunta pagkatapos ng trabaho?\NDHuwag silang magkrus ang landas."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.96,1:04:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ganyan mga secretaries...\N- Hindi lang kami.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.96,1:04:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Lahat ng manggagawa ay namamatay din.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.84,1:04:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas gusto nila kapag wala kang pakialam,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.80,1:04:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit nakakaranas ka ng mabuti at masamang araw kamakailan.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.05,1:04:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapat na. Buti na lang hindi ko narinig.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.64,1:04:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinagsalitaan mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.47,1:04:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, may isang bagay na magagawa mo para sa amin.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.14,1:04:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nananatiling mabait.\N- Sapat na.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.85,1:04:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas maganda kung maglalakbay ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.60,1:04:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sa ibang bansa, kung maaari.\N- Hindi ka ba busy?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.15,1:04:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre ako. Ako ang iyong sekretarya.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.53,1:04:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Naghahapunan kayo ni Mr. Yoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.28,1:04:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Madalas mo siyang nakikita.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.99,1:04:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Maganda ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.79,1:04:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang split level.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.45,1:04:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi masama ang entry fee na 8%,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.21,1:04:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,pero bakit gusto niyang kumuha si Hercyna\N ng sarili nilang mga empleyado?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.38,1:04:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon ang tuntunin niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.59,1:04:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kailangang 27 o mas bata ang mga manggagawa.\N- Alam ko, pero bakit?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.51,1:04:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayaw niyang ibenta ng mga lumang\Nempleyo ang kanyang mga produkto.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.31,1:04:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kapani-paniwala.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.43,1:05:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nakakatakot sa pagtanda?\NIIto ay talagang isang pagpapala.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.60,1:05:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay mahusay at isang bagay upang makipaglaban.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.69,1:05:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang ganda.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.48,1:05:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakadiri siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.49,1:05:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So susuko ka na ba? Halos lahat ng kondisyon namin ay tinanggap niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.62,1:05:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,"Amin"?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.21,1:05:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang iyong mga kundisyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.79,1:05:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, tinanggap niya ang mga kondisyon ko...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.38,1:05:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,para sa iyong kapakanan,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.34,1:05:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya sabihin mo sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.43,1:05:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang gusto mo?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.64,1:05:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong may utang ako sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.98,1:05:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel uneasy, since you're\Nnot asking me for a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.48,1:05:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung ito ay isang bagay na magagawa ko\Nngayon, pagkatapos ay gagawin ko ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.40,1:05:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hiwalayan mo siya.\N- Ano?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.20,1:05:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiwalayan si Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.20,1:06:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ang gusto ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.33,1:06:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Balak ka niyang iwan.\NItatago mo pa ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.60,1:06:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon ang negosyo ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.01,1:06:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crossing the line again.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.73,1:06:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat ba talaga akong tumawid sa linya ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.44,1:06:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano kung ako...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.03,1:06:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,pinalitan siya?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.34,1:06:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Lalagpas na ako sa linya\Kung talagang tinanong kita niyan.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.15,1:07:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako makakain.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.95,1:07:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko matunaw ng maayos ang pagkain kapag nasaktan ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.95,1:08:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Siya ay inampon ng isang Korean family noong 12.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.41,1:08:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring malawak ang U.S., ngunit\Nmaliit ang komunidad ng Korea.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.87,1:08:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang aming bagong internasyonal na abogado\Nused upang manirahan sa kanyang kapitbahayan.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.17,1:08:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi sila close, pero kilalang-kilala ang pamilya niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.96,1:08:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Paano?\N- Di-nagtagal pagkatapos siyang ampon.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.13,1:08:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Lumipat sa mas malaking bahay ang adoptive parents niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.13,1:08:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapos pinapunta nila siya sa\Npinakamahal na pribadong paaralan.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.76,1:08:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hill Crawford Academy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.05,1:08:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang taunang tuition ay nagkakahalaga ng mahigit $60,000,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.35,1:08:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi mayaman ang kanyang mga magulang.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.27,1:08:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaabot mo ba ang kanyang mga magulang?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.27,1:08:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinignan ko nga.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.35,1:08:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Namatay silang dalawa.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.06,1:08:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay aksidente sa pagmamaneho ng lasing,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.11,1:08:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit inisip ng mga tao na kakaiba ito,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.40,1:08:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil wala sa kanila ang umiinom.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.99,1:09:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala ka dapat dito.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.91,1:09:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta ang lugar na ito? Ito ay walang laman sa loob ng mahabang panahon.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.71,1:09:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.79,1:09:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Napanatag ang loob ko na malaman na ang anak ko ay\N nakatira sa iisang bubong na kasama ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.59,1:09:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabi ko umalis ka na.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.30,1:09:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kailangan mong maging mas maingat, Ms. Moh.\N- Huwag mo akong tawaging ganyan. Tawagin mo akong "Mom."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.10,1:09:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinabi mo sa akin na huwag kang tatawagin ng ganyan,\Nkaya pinigilan ko ang sarili ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.18,1:09:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngayon hindi ko na masabi.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.15,1:09:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.40,1:10:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Meron kaming nakaraan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.03,1:10:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero hindi ako nagsisisi.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.87,1:10:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Talaga? Kailan ito ang buhay mo ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.87,1:10:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Siya ay isang housekeeper.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.12,1:10:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kanina pa siya nandito.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.67,1:10:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Masasabi mong para siyang...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.17,1:10:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}ang punong kasambahay na umaasa kay Lolo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.71,1:10:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Huwag mo siyang pansinin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.84,1:10:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Siya ay walang tao.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.30,1:10:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}At doon...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.89,1:10:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sus, maalat iyon.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.97,1:10:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ms. Nawala na si Moh.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.64,1:10:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Bakit ito napakaalat?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.18,1:10:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kaya dapat mo siyang paalisin sa sandaling ito.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.27,1:10:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Gagawin ko na sana\Naman kung ako ang bahala.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.02,1:10:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Kumain ka na. Ayos ang ibang ulam.\N- Okay.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.24,1:10:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hindi mo ba naaalala ang lahat...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.44,1:10:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,natalo ka sa nakalipas na 30 taon?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.37,1:10:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre ginagawa ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.62,1:10:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong panatilihing malapit ang aking anak,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.29,1:10:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,at ako mismo ang nagpalaki sa kanya,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.21,1:11:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,pero kung gagawin ko, hindi ka\Nnakakuha ng masasarap na pagkain sa kaarawan,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.13,1:11:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,o mga bagong uniporme ng paaralan.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.09,1:11:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagiging dumi kami.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.68,1:11:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasabihin ko sana, "We're family. Hang in there."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.26,1:11:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,, "Malapit nang mapansin ang mga bagay,"
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.55,1:11:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi mangyayari iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.90,1:11:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang ganda ng bahay, di ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.65,1:11:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sobrang metikuloso ni Chairman Hong.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.40,1:11:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Inabot siya ng limang taon para itayo ang bahay na ito,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.65,1:11:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,kapag tumagal ito ng isang taon.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.70,1:11:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinili pa niya kung aling mga bato ang ilalagay sa hardin,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.83,1:11:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,pero malapit na...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.58,1:11:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,sipain namin silang lahat,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.96,1:11:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,at sarili natin ang bahay na ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.80,1:11:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag isipin na hindi ito patas.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.13,1:11:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Bago lang namin ang ayos ng mga bagay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.01,1:11:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasa pamilyang ito ang lahat ng gusto nila.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.64,1:11:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Masaya sila,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.06,1:11:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,at ngayon...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.68,1:12:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,kami na ang bahala...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.98,1:12:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,at maging masaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.73,1:12:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas pabaya ka sa inaakala ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.53,1:12:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo ba magiging madali ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.07,1:12:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}- I...\N- Hindi, ayun.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.24,1:12:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Sipain mo ako ng bola.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.53,1:12:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Gusto ko ring gawin ito.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.99,1:12:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Nandiyan na.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.58,1:12:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Guys, uminom kayo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.12,1:12:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Nagdala ng inumin si Mommy.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.08,1:12:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}- Tara na.\N- Pwede na ba natin?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.79,1:12:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Maari ba talaga nating inumin ito?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.96,1:12:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Halika dito!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.05,1:12:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kabutihan, aking prinsesa.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.30,1:12:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Gising ka na ba?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.64,1:12:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Goodness, ang ganda mo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.52,1:12:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}{\i1}Kabutihan.{\i0}{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.44,1:12:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Beom-jun, mag-ingat.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.36,1:12:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Guys, tumingin dito.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.82,1:12:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}- Carry me.\N- Oo naman.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.53,1:12:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasiyahan si Chairman Hong sa kanyang kaligayahan sa harap namin,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.74,1:12:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,at naaalala pa niya ang mga oras na iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.61,1:12:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi pa namin sila inaalis.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.37,1:12:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hindi ka mahuhulog.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.37,1:12:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi tayo dapat...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.79,1:12:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,kampante tulad nito.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.55,1:13:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano ito?\N- Gamitin ito kahit anong gusto mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.55,1:13:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Saan ko kaya ito magagamit?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.68,1:13:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinabi sa akin ni Secretary Jang na iimbestigahan ka para sa secret fund.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.98,1:13:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi makukulong ang iyong anak o apo para sa iyo,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.60,1:13:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil marami sila sa kanilang plato.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.23,1:13:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- So?\N- I'll go instead.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.40,1:13:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin na natin ng palihim\Niloko ang iyong sekretong pondo...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.53,1:13:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,sa pamamagitan ng scholarship foundation.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.28,1:13:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako miyembro ng board\N o ang iyong pamilya ayon sa batas.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.33,1:13:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung aakohin ko ang responsibilidad, hindi mo\Nkailangang mag-alala tungkol sa panganib ng may-ari.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.08,1:13:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kahit na i-cover ito ng media,\NI can take the fall alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.46,1:13:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang karangalan na kailangan kong panatilihin,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.59,1:13:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya okay lang.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.26,1:13:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Itatanong ako at sa halip ay makukulong.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.72,1:13:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-alala.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.15,1:14:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas magaling ka...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.94,1:14:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,kaysa sa pinagsama-samang lahat ng anak ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.66,1:15:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.04,1:15:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ang lamig mo sa labas? Nasaan ang sasakyan mo?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.17,1:15:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan ito? Nasaan si Mr. Oh?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.65,1:15:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako sigurado.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.15,1:15:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano ako nakarating dito?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.32,1:15:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Patuloy kong nakikita ang aking sarili na ganito sa mga araw na ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.91,1:15:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Patuloy na umaalis ang oras kapag\NI ay nauubusan na ng oras.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.33,1:15:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano naman sayo?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.13,1:15:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano mo nalaman na nandito ako?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.13,1:16:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakilala mo ba ang payong na ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.64,1:16:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Naaalala mo bang ibinigay mo ito sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.06,1:16:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Natulala talaga ako noon.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.27,1:16:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.52,1:16:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mo akong bigyan ng ganyang tingin.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.61,1:16:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,May 51% na pagkakataon.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.40,1:16:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari akong pumunta sa Germany at magpagamot.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.13,1:16:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.21,1:16:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo ako tinatawagan?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.20,1:17:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama. Alam mo naman si Ye-na diba? Naaksidente siya sa sasakyan dalawang araw na ang nakalipas.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.87,1:17:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay nahimatay at pumunta sa ED.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.33,1:17:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Siya ay nahimatay at pumunta sa ED.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.33,1:17:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Tapos ang asawa niya...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.25,1:17:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay sumugod ang kanyang asawa at ang kanyang abogado.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.13,1:17:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagdulot siya ng eksena at sinabing\Nkailangan niyang baguhin ang kanyang kalooban.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.63,1:17:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakaingay niya kaya nagising siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.44,1:17:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Umiiyak ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.40,1:17:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.57,1:17:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tungkol saan?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.92,1:17:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ganyan ka ba nag-aalala?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.88,1:18:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-alala.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.82,1:18:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.78,1:18:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahal kita.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.83,1:19:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeong-suk ang pangalan niya.\N- Kalimutan mo na.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.12,1:19:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kilala ko ang pangalan na iyon.\N- Oo, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.01,1:19:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Matagal nang nakalipas.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.43,1:19:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinatawagan pa rin niya?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.18,1:19:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queens Department Store Guide Map{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.39,1:19:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Baek, alam mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.27,1:19:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Naninirahan ang isang raccoon sa aming rooftop garden.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.06,1:19:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi pwede yun.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.15,1:19:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang raccoon sa Seoul.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.40,1:19:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakita ko siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.32,1:19:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Maraming beses.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.07,1:19:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Talaga?\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.07,1:19:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lalabas lang siya sa pagtatago kapag\Nit ay walang laman at tinatawag mo ang kanyang pangalan.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.79,1:19:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Lumalabas siya?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.50,1:20:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Imposible iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.67,1:20:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat mong isipin na tanga ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.96,1:20:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Seryoso ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.13,1:20:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeong-suk ang pangalan niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.06,1:20:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagsisinungaling ka, di ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.81,1:20:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tawagin ang kanyang pangalan kapag walang tao,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.23,1:20:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,pero lumalabas lang siya kapag gusto niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.53,1:20:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Halika. Huwag kang magsinungaling.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.12,1:20:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagsisinungaling ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.04,1:20:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakaganda niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.38,1:20:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Niloloko mo na naman ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.38,1:20:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagsisinungaling ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.26,1:20:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Malaki at bilog ang mga mata niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.34,1:20:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong mamahalin mo rin siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.81,1:21:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, pero hindi mo ako niloloko.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.57,1:21:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay isang tanga. Naniniwala pa rin siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.24,1:21:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Naniniwala ba siya sa lahat ng sinasabi ko?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.12,1:21:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder pinakasalan niya ako pagkatapos kong sabihin...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.04,1:21:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ipapasaya ko siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.93,1:21:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeong-suk.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.84,1:21:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lumabas ka kung nandito ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.72,1:21:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeong-suk?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.41,1:21:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeong-suk!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.33,1:22:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kitang makita, Yeong-suk.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.51,1:22:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Reyna ng Luha{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.71,1:22:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Siya ay tumakbo sa mga laps, at muling kumuha ng rice soup.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.21,1:22:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Masaya ba ito?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.84,1:22:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Paano ko siya iiwan?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.55,1:22:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Lumabas.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.55,1:22:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Isang reunion? Isang bar? Isa lang ang sagot.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.68,1:22:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Isang maybahay.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.47,1:23:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Bakit nandito ka pa at\Npapahiya sila sa iyo?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.35,1:23:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Iyon ay magiging...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.56,1:23:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}ang pinakamagandang araw ng buhay ko.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.48,1:23:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Ako pa rin ang pipiliin niya.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.11,1:23:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Ikaw! Hayaan mo siya!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.82,1:23:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}...at kung susubukan mong saktan siya,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.53,1:23:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Gayundin ang gagawin ko sa iyo.{\i0}
